{"3897440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Another Shoplifting Simulator", "steam_appid": 3897440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE ART OF STEALING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The shelves are full. Customers, staff and cameras are watching. Grab what you can, and sneak out before anyone notices! You made it out? Don’t relax just yet, it gets harder each day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUSTED!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getting spotted means full-blown panic. Staff will chase you down, but you can still escape the shop. If they catch you, say good-bye to your inventory and precious time!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ALL YOU CAN GRAB!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Back-to-back stealing adds to your combo, increases payout and makes you go faster! It’s tempting, isn’t it? Greed is good, until you’re caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >READ THE ROOM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The shop gradually makes life harder. Doubling money goal, more traffic, more cautious staff. Can you push through, or will you give up?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GEAR UP OR GO DOWN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, you get a new gadget. Use it wisely! Increased capacity, enhanced strategy, easier looting? Each item is good for something!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PARTNERS IN CRIME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite your friend along and plunder the store together in the multiplayer mode, or play as a guard, catching the shoplifter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In solo play, climb the leaderboards to prove you’re the best thief worldwide!</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE ART OF STEALING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The shelves are full. Customers, staff and cameras are watching. Grab what you can, and sneak out before anyone notices! You made it out? Don’t relax just yet, it gets harder each day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUSTED!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getting spotted means full-blown panic. Staff will chase you down, but you can still escape the shop. If they catch you, say good-bye to your inventory and precious time!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ALL YOU CAN GRAB!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Back-to-back stealing adds to your combo, increases payout and makes you go faster! It’s tempting, isn’t it? Greed is good, until you’re caught.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >READ THE ROOM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The shop gradually makes life harder. Doubling money goal, more traffic, more cautious staff. Can you push through, or will you give up?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GEAR UP OR GO DOWN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day, you get a new gadget. Use it wisely! Increased capacity, enhanced strategy, easier looting? Each item is good for something!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PARTNERS IN CRIME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite your friend along and plunder the store together in the multiplayer mode, or play as a guard, catching the shoplifter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In solo play, climb the leaderboards to prove you’re the best thief worldwide!</p>", "short_description": "Pocket snacks. Dodge guards. Profit. Sneak your way through the store as the shoplifter to make enough money, with the goal doubling daily in this casual FPS simulator!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897440/a87bd2e1adad0358eb1f28af5ba2d2f390353bdd/header.jpg?t=1781781393", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897440/063717511da05dc4dfe9587df2381c8510cbb66a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781781393", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it